ity of our customers and counterparties to perform under their contracts with us, including through terminations by customers of any contract in part or in full, has reduced and, in the future, could significantly reduce our net sales and negatively impact our results of operations.","source":"FSLR-0001274494-26-000021","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-02-24","proof":"3a811bc891a4158adfb8cc9a7a8e35f71b2832fd3b8bebc1619d7a1f78060503"},"FSLR.q.riskrwwas.0":{"c":"FSLR","kind":"risk-was","quote":"The loss of any of our large customers, or the inability of our customers and counterparties to perform under their contracts with us, could significantly reduce our net sales and negatively impact our results of operations.","source":"FSLR-0001274494-25-000010","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-02-25","proof":"1988f17dedd57aa3b3a75220c6a58f3cf0dacca3c27f5275faf4b4d734268633"},"FSLR.q.riskrw.1":{"c":"FSLR","kind":"risk","quote":"Our failure to effectively manage module manufacturing and related costs, including costs related to raw materials and logistics services, could render our solar modules uncompetitive and reduce our net sales, profitability, and/or market share.","source":"FSLR-0001274494-26-000021","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-02-24","proof":"9472492b56c262a494b8e13e23be2121bcf97993711a91d68bc1b13de00ca769"},"FSLR.q.riskrwwas.1":{"c":"FSLR","kind":"risk-was","quote":"Our failure to effectively manage module manufacturing production and selling costs, including costs related to raw materials and logistics services, could render our solar modules uncompetitive and reduce our net sales, profitability, and/or market share.","source":"FSLR-0001274494-25-000010","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-02-25","proof":"fdbe12b33733369a884cdc186f00283ca041c63135e38275cb34887ce08bc17c"}},"sources":{"FSLR-0001274494-25-000010":{"kind":"prior-annual-report","by":"FSLR","form":"10-K","period":"2024-12-31","date":"2025-02-25","accn":"0001274494-25-000010","title":"Fi